  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENPI 2010 Gender</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ENPI 2010 Gender</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet bidrar med en expert p&#xe5; genderfr&#xe5;gor, vars uppgift &#xe4;r att integrera genderperspektiv i EU-kommissionens kommande program i Moldavien f&#xf6;r perioden 2010 - 2012.Project closed by Dec 1 2010, due to delay in signing of the agreement between govt of Moldova and EU on ESRA, timing and remaining funds insufficient to develop a pilot project on women econ. empowerment.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is Gender TA provided in a joint programming with EC Delegation for the SPSP ESRA NAP 2010-2012, value 47 MEuro budget support. The aim is to integrate gender perspective into the Identification and Formulation studies and fisches, resulting in a gender mainstreamed Action Fiche and Policy Matrix ESRA. A pilot project will be developed on WEE,ESRA is to be coord.with UNIFEM WEE.</narrative>
  </description>
